      "location": {
        "pointer": "/method/conditionalEdgesAreDisjoint"
      },
      "text": "The 18 conditional edges share no pair with the 48 next edges, so a graph built from next alone misclassifies every gated child as an externally scheduled root and reports 26 roots instead of 12.",
      "category": "NARRATIVE"
    },
    {
      "occurrenceId": "ced3fd962ff1ee2bb1ec693334d9b0291fc53a01fd0bfd913f8d080329c35dbf",
